WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.836
Mole and Rat opened the door.

2
00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:10.054
Outside, ten young field mice stood in a line.

3
00:00:10.055 --> 00:00:13.303
"What fine boys!" said Rat.

4
00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:18.001
"What colorful red mufflers!" cried Mole.

5
00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:21.215
The mice looked up with bright eyes.

6
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:24.400
An older mouse held up a lantern.

7
00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:29.768
"Now, one, two, three!" he cried.

8
00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:35.074
Together, their tiny voices rose in the air.

9
00:00:35.075 --> 00:00:39.815
Let your doors open wide.

10
00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:44.078
Even with the snow outside,

11
00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:50.192
Bring us in by the fire.

12
00:00:50.193 --> 00:00:56.574
You will have joy in the morning!

13
00:00:56.575 --> 00:01:01.142
Here we stand in the cold and sleet,

14
00:01:01.143 --> 00:01:05.412
Frozen fingers and frozen feet.

15
00:01:05.413 --> 00:01:11.781
You by the fire, bring us in from the street.

16
00:01:11.782 --> 00:01:19.708
You will have joy in the morning!

17
00:01:19.709 --> 00:01:23.481
The mice ended their song and smiled.

18
00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:27.117
"Very well sung!" cried Rat.

19
00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:32.209
"Ah, listen!" said Mole. "The bells!"

20
00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:37.312
Church bells rang in the distance.

21
00:01:37.313 --> 00:01:39.301
"Now come on in.

22
00:01:39.302 --> 00:01:41.499
All of you!" said Rat.

23
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.237
"Yes, come in!" said Mole, smiling.

24
00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:48.208
"This is just like old times.

25
00:01:48.209 --> 00:01:53.422
I always give the mice a feast after they sing."

26
00:01:53.423 --> 00:01:57.219
The field mice all hurried inside.

27
00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.368
They stood by the fire, warming their paws.

28
00:02:01.369 --> 00:02:04.723
Mole was suddenly upset.

29
00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:10.099
"Rat," he said, "we have nothing to give them!"

30
00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.351
"I'll take care of it!" said Rat.

31
00:02:13.352 --> 00:02:17.094
Rat pointed to the older mouse with the lantern.

32
00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:19.436
He was the choir leader.

33
00:02:19.437 --> 00:02:21.547
"Come here," Rat said.

34
00:02:21.548 --> 00:02:25.024
"I want to talk to you."

